      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Signal type:** Measured\n\n**Source:** CloudWatch namespace `AWS/CloudFront`, region `us-east-1`, dimensions `DistributionId=${distribution}`, `Region=Global`.\n\n**Freshness:** CloudFront publishes one-minute data points, usually a few minutes behind.\n\n**Read carefully:** requests count every file fetched (HTML, scripts, images, video) and include bots, so they are not visitors. Visitor experience needs CloudWatch RUM (planned).\n\n**Not shown yet:** availability checks (Synthetics), releases (GitHub Actions), audit events (CloudTrail)."
